# Transient nix-build symlinks. Created by `nix build` when invoked
# WITHOUT --no-link (e.g. by hand from src/). The build.sh engine uses
# `nix build --no-link --print-out-paths` so they should never appear,
# but a manual nix build can leave one behind. Gitignored so it never
# gets force-added (`git add -f`); engine also skips them in cp.
src/result
src/result-*
result
result-*
